---
layout: layouts/base.njk
bodyClass: page-article
---
{%- set headings = content | toc -%}
<article class="article" aria-labelledby="article-title">
  <header class="article__header">
    <div class="page-container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="현재 위치">
        <ol>
          <li><a href="/">홈</a></li>
          <li><span aria-current="page">{{ series }} {{ seriesNumber }}</span></li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      <h1 id="article-title" class="t-h2 article__title">{{ title }}</h1>
      <p class="article__lead">{{ description }}</p>
      <dl class="meta-list meta-list--row">
        <div><dt>공식 문서 확인</dt><dd><time datetime="{{ verifiedAt }}">{{ verifiedAt | koDate }}</time> (KST)</dd></div>
        <div><dt>읽는 시간</dt><dd>약 {{ content | readingMinutes }}분</dd></div>
        <div><dt>상태</dt><dd>{{ statusLabel }}</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="band">
    <div class="page-container">
      <div class="frame article__layout">
        {%- if headings.length %}
        <nav class="toc" aria-labelledby="toc-title">
          <details class="toc__details" open>
            <summary id="toc-title" class="mono-label toc__title">이 글의 차례</summary>
            <ol class="toc__list">
              {%- for h in headings %}
              <li><a href="#{{ h.id }}">{{ h.text }}</a></li>
              {%- endfor %}
              <li><a href="#sources">출처와 확인일</a></li>
            </ol>
          </details>
        </nav>
        {%- endif %}

        <div class="prose">
          {{ content | safe }}

          <section class="sources" aria-labelledby="sources">
            <h2 id="sources">출처와 확인일</h2>
            <p>아래 공식 문서를 <time datetime="{{ verifiedAt }}">{{ verifiedAt | koDate }}</time> (KST)에 직접 열어 확인했습니다. 문서는 바뀔 수 있으니, 내용이 다르면 공식 문서를 따르세요.</p>
            <ol class="sources__list">
              {%- for s in sources %}
              <li>
                <a href="{{ s.url }}" lang="en">{{ s.title }}</a>
                <span class="sources__url">{{ s.url | replace("https://", "") }}</span>
              </li>
              {%- endfor %}
            </ol>
          </section>

          <p class="article__back"><a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> 홈으로</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
